# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# The Android project is generated by `npx cap add android` in the APK workflow. Committing
# it would track ~40 template files and their splash bitmaps for a build input, not source.
/android

# icon.png is copied from public/icons here by the workflow just before @capacitor/assets
# renders the launcher and splash bitmaps into the generated project.
/assets

# Vite bakes any value in these into the public bundle, so they must never be committed or deployed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
